u}$ as well as other observables involving $B$ mesons like $R(K^{(*)})$, ${m Br}(B_s	o\mu^+\mu^-)$, ${m Br}(B^+	o K^+\mu^+\mu^-)$, and $P_5'(B^+	o K^{*+}\mu^+\mu^-)$. We find that the new physics scale $M_{m NP}$ to be $2.04~{m TeV}\le M_{m NP} \le 11.76~{m TeV}$ (at $1\sigma$) for ordinary heavy new mediators. Our predictions for the branching ratios ${m Br}(\Lambda_b	o\Lambda^{(*)}
